world inspired by late 80s and 90s anime culture.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>FEATURES:</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>TURN-BASED ELEMENTAL COMBAT!</u></strong> - Legends of Celestite RPG combines intense battles with a rich, dark-fantasy, &quot;shonen-like&quot; storyline. Each ally who joins the player can fill several roles in combat, such as Tank, DPS, Debuffer, Healer, or Supporter, or do whatever you want to do with them. The battle system also features element-based damage tactics that must be overcome by enhancing yourself with abilities. There are also special aura buffs, adding strategic depth when forming your favourite teams of three. There are a total of nine playable characters throughout part one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>ANIMATED ATB BATTLE SYSTEM!</u></strong>- The battle sprites are animated, not static. Fast-paced and punchy ATB System! Unleash combo additions and build your Cross-Skill Meter for more powerful attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Collectibles and Secrets</u></strong> await you in Azmoria. Discover Abacus Tokens that help unlock the rarest items/weapons/armours and chests within the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>POWER &amp; CONTROL!</u></strong> - Unlock abilities with CP (Celestite Points) and learn/empower your abilities the way you want to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>There is <strong>no\u00a0sexual or romantic content in this particular game</strong>. This game is <strong>intended</strong> for ages 14+. However, It does contain pixelated blood and dead body sprites, self-harm to protect one-self as well as a very minor insinuation of suicide by jumping. Parental advisory for those ages 13 and under.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Adventurer's notes:</i></strong><i> I strongly recommend playing the game in Window Mode. You can do this by pressing F3 on your keyboard to minimize the screen. You can still use Full-Screen while doing this. The game comes with character cards, concept art, wallpapers and more for personal non-commercial use.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699950/extras/b113408de13c69c4e7f1031898466f7f.avif?t=1763411206\" width=990 height=990 /></span></p>","developers":["Raven Burns"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699950/af974517ee081d6ac397011ba4129318eb13c7aa/header.jpg?t=1763411206","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"All rights reserved. No part of this publication may be reproduced, copied or transmitted in any form or by any means. That includes photocopying, taking photos, recording, or any other electronic or mechanical strategies, without the prior written permission of the publisher. This agreement, however, excludes brief quotations embodied in critical reviews and specific non-commercial uses permitted by copyright law.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1699950/1622199160/107c6b0e22b6614d23546b7e9f1832f7d5a2b949/1763410361/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763411204","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1699950/1622199160/107c6b0e22b6614d23546b7e9f1832f7d5a2b949/1763410361/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763411204","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1699950/1622199160/107c6b0e22b6614d23546b7e9f1832f7d5a2b949/1763410361/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763411204","id":257001895,"name":"Story/Reveal Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam